dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Dark Mode",
  "description": "Maps+ example: PNG markers in a dark dashboard.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Map rows",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv \n| eval markerColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"red\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"pink\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"green\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"orange\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"darkred\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\"),\nicon=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\"),\nlayerDescription=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\")\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", tooltip=description, clusterGroup=\"default\"\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerColor, icon, clusterGroup, layerDescription",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "PNG Markers allow for limited color styling. Available marker colors include:\n\n`red` `darkred` `lightred` `orange` `beige` `green` `darkgreen` `lightgreen` `blue` `darkblue` `lightblue` `purple` `darkpurple` `pink` `cadetblue` `white` `gray` `lightgray` `black`\n\nCustomize markers with icons from [Font Awesome](https://fontawesome.com/v4.7.0/icons/) or [Ionicons](https://ionicons.com/).\n\nDisabling clustering at a particular zoom level can result in sluggish performance. This example illustrates that in high density areas when panning in the map."
      }
    },
    "viz_map": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "Custom Marker Colors, Font Awesome Icons, Disable Clustering At Zoom Level (16), Single Cluster Group,",
      "description": "markerColor, icon, tooltip, description, clusterGroup, layerDescription",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoomLevel": "16",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldownAction": "dblclick",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "14",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.i18nLanguage": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "39.50",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-98.35",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "6",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "http://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/dark_all/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathRenderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.renderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.useOpenFreeMap": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maplibreStylePreset": "dark"
      }
    },
    "viz_teach": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## What this shows\nChicago crime rows from a lookup, drawn as classic **PNG pins**. Colour and Font Awesome icon are chosen per crime type, all rows share one cluster group, and clustering switches off at zoom 16 (option `disableClusteringAtZoom`).\n\n## The SPL\n```spl\n| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv \n| eval markerColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"red\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"pink\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"green\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"orange\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"darkred\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\"),\nicon=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\"),\nlayerDescription=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\")\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", tooltip=description, clusterGroup=\"default\"\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerColor, icon, clusterGroup, layerDescription\n```\n\n## How it works\n1. `inputlookup chicago-crime.csv` loads the rows, which already carry `latitude`, `longitude` and `description`.\n2. First `eval` uses `case(like(description, ...))` to give each crime type a `markerColor`, an `icon` and a `layerDescription`; `1=1` is the catch-all default.\n3. Second `eval` wraps `description` in `<b>`, copies it to `tooltip`, and sets `clusterGroup=\"default\"` so every marker clusters together. Assignments in one `eval` run left to right, so `tooltip` gets the bold text.\n4. `table` keeps only the fields Maps+ reads. There is no `markerType`, so Maps+ uses `png`.\n\n## Field formats and rules\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `41.88`) | Exact lowercase name, required on marker rows. Only the first row is checked; if it has no `latitude`+`longitude` the panel shows an error. |\n| `longitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `-87.72`) | Exact lowercase name. Longitude is negative west of Greenwich. Rows at 0,0 usually mean missing coordinates. |\n| `markerColor` | name from the PNG palette | png markers only accept: red darkred lightred orange beige green darkgreen lightgreen blue darkblue lightblue purple darkpurple pink cadetblue white gray lightgray black. Anything else (e.g. `#1f78b4`) renders a blank marker. |\n| `icon` | Font Awesome name, no `fa-` prefix | `battery-2`, not `fa-battery-2`. `prefix` defaults to `fa`; other values are `fab`, `ion`, `glyphicon`. |\n| `markerType` | `png`, `svg`, `icon`, `circle`, `custom` or `milsymbol` | Not set here, so the default `png` applies. Any other value throws `Invalid markerType`. |\n| `tooltip` | HTML string | Hover text. Raw HTML. Wrapped in `<b>` here. Escape any text that comes from events. |\n| `description` | HTML string | Click popup. Raw HTML. Wrapped in `<b>` here. Escape any text that comes from events. |\n| `clusterGroup` | any name except `one`, `two`, `three` | Rows with different groups never cluster together. |\n| `layerDescription` | HTML string | Label in the layer control; the last row of a layer wins. Layers default to one per `icon` name. |\n\n## Try it\n- Change `\"red\"` to `\"purple\"` in the `markerColor` case and watch the SIMPLE pins change. Use a palette name only.\n- Change `clusterGroup=\"default\"` to `clusterGroup=if(like(description,\"%TO VEHICLE%\"),\"veh\",\"default\")` to stop vehicle crimes clustering with the rest.\n\nStudio note: In Dashboard Studio on Maps+ 4.6.9 and earlier the icon font is blocked, so the glyph inside a pin renders as an empty box; colour, tooltip, popup and layers all work. Classic dashboards show the glyph. Studio note: the original `mapTile` (a CARTO URL) is kept, but this Studio version turns on keyless OpenFreeMap (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1), because CARTO tiles show an \"API KEY REQUIRED\" watermark without a key.\n\n**Basemap:** this example uses keyless OpenFreeMap vector tiles (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1). CARTO basemaps need a free API key: see **Help > Basemaps & API keys** for how to get one and where to put it (**Map Tile Override**)."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 950,
          "display": "auto"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_intro",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 190
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 190,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 760
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_teach",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 190,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 760
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
